WEBVTT

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.250
Body.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.750
Soul.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.910
Spirit.

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:33.000
A wanderer who has almost lost these three.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:46.000
He wonders if he can fulfill this sinner's wish.

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:49.750
This is, without a doubt...

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.540
His final chance.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.870
No matter the outcome of this battle,

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:57.900
He will die this way.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.910
Squandering his soul,

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:03.000
departing from the cycle of rebirth,

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.000
he will...

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.660
turn into nothingness.

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:12.460
Even so,

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:17.620
will you still rush toward the end of your journey?

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:32.160
I see.

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:33.410
This is...

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:36.440
the end of my journey...?

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:39.540
This time...

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.700
With my own hands...

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.530
I will kill my King.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.070
Wow...

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:16.910
How do you feel, Fujimaru? Mash?

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:19.040
It was made of scraps,

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:20.040
but it's pretty good, right?

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.500
You're certainly in high spirits, Da Vinci.

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:23.500
Why, of course!

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.540
Up until now,

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:27.330
we weren't able to enter a "singularity" together.

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:27.960
Yes!

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:29.670
We're counting on you.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:30.700
Oh!

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:31.870
Romani here.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:33.640
Let's go over the situation, shall we?

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:35.200
Please do.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.350
Alright.

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:37.660
You're all currently in...

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:39.850
the year of A.D.1273.

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:42.790
The 9th Cruciata failed,

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:44.160
the Catholic Church

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:47.040
lost its influence over Jerusalem.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.080
The Mamluk Dynasty,

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.290
the Mongol Empire,

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.820
and the Christians were in discord.

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.450
Probably the one who hosted the Holy Grail

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:56.240
was one of the survivors of the Crusaders.

00:03:56.910 --> 00:03:59.160
The Holy Grail has always gone

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:00.750
to the ones who lose.

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:05.230
The Holy Grail...

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.950
But then again,

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.240
is this really...

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:12.220
the Kingdom of Jerusalem?

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:14.500
According to the coordinates,

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.910
the citadel's fortress should be here, but...

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:20.140
It seems like something has happened already.

00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:21.790
A perfect example

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:23.100
is that.

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:27.450
A city?

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:28.620
A castle?

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.370
According to the architectural design,

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.820
it clearly not belongs to this land.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.200
This is bad!

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:35.530
Whoa!

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:53.700
Oh?

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:55.280
It flashed!

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:57.950
Because of the jump,

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:00.160
this part got detached.

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:02.620
I see!

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:04.370
The atmospheric mana was absorbed...

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.770
This is why I can't tolerate a genius!

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.860
Are you alright, Senpai?

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:12.820
Please let me fix this thing.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.710
Wow!

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:27.290
As expected from you, Mash.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.040
Hey!

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:52.210
This is...

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:55.570
These aren't ancient ruins...

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:57.780
Such...

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.790
This is a much worse

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.000
situation than we expected.

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:05.000
Let's hurry.

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:47.700
Are you Arash Kamangir?

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.710
Yeah, that's what they call me.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:55.800
I'm Lucius.

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:57.160
Truly...

00:06:57.160 --> 00:07:00.260
It's an honour to meet a great Persian hero like you.

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:05.040
For you to believe that I'm truly Arash.

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.010
Are you a Servant?

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:11.190
I've heard that you're familiar with the Holy City.

00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:14.520
Yes, but I've never actually been inside.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:16.410
Want a bite?

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:16.980
No.

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:22.750
At this place,

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.320
you will see all sorts of people.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:29.370
People who have given up.

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.330
People who have despaired.

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:35.500
People who have forgotten tomorrow.

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.750
I wonder, which one are you?

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:41.500
An aura of death...

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:44.720
with a yearning for self-destruction.

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:46.200
That's your face.

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:48.470
I have no wish for self-destruction.

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:51.390
Is that so?

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:53.700
Due to your heavy burden,

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.900
hasn't it been a while since you lifted your face?

00:07:56.690 --> 00:07:59.860
Looking down at nothing but your feet.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:03.820
Anyway, why are you
interested in the Holy City?

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:05.790
No matter what,

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.660
there's someone I must find.

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:08.950
For that reason,

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:11.660
I want to know everything about the Holy City.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:16.830
In that case,

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:18.170
let's start from the beginning.

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:20.630
Those refugees.

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:23.650
Do you know where they're from?

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:24.650
No.

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.370
The land of Canaan was covered up...

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:28.330
by a desert about half a year ago.

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:31.450
This was due to the appearance

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:33.950
of the Crusaders, led by Richard I.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.200
The Crusaders?

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.790
I thought they were wiped out.

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:37.790
Yeah.

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:39.910
They obtained the Holy Grail...

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:42.990
and used its unfathomable power to form this desert.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.660
These refugees are the results.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:48.910
However, the Crusaders were annihilated

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:51.790
by the Lion King Arthur and the Knights of the Round Table.

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.620
Having destroyed the Crusaders,

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:58.040
and the city of Jerusalem,

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:01.000
they built the Holy City in a single night.

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:05.280
I wonder if I could listen in as well?

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:07.870
And you are...?

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:09.120
The Great Genius,

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:10.790
Leonardo Da Vinci!

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:13.770
Member of the Organization for the Preservation of Human Order, Chaldea.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.190
Chaldea?

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:20.400
The organization that's here to restore this destroyed place.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:24.650
I'm the same as you, a Servant.

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:27.410
Sounds like a big deal.

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:30.120
However, a young lady like you, all alone?

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:31.410
No way!

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:32.750
My stalwart Master...

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:33.910
and friends are here as well.

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:36.790
Master, eh?

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.630
I'd like to meet him.

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:43.590
We suspect that the key to this
incident lies within the Holy City.

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:46.550
How do we get in there?

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.930
Well, I guess you'd find out eventually.

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:56.950
Beyond the Eastern Gate lies an entrance to the Holy City.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:10:01.610
Only on nights of the new moon, the
Holy City opens its gates allowing refugees in.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:05.320
The Holy Selection actually happens to be tonight.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:09.070
The refugees in this city
have gathered here for this day.

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:12.280
However, no one has ever
returned from the Holy City.

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:13.740
No one?

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:15.000
Yeah.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:17.210
No one knows why.

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:19.160
Well then, as for what's inside the Holy City...

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:21.170
No one really knows, right?

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.160
I'm sorry that I can't help much.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.500
Not at all.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:26.330
You have my gratitude.

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:27.620
You're leaving already?

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:29.550
I'd like to hear your story too.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:32.760
It has nothing to do with you.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.000
My King.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:58.950
Please...

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:01.210
have mercy on this child.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:04.200
It has been five days since we last ate.

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:04.830
Please—

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:05.790
My apologies.

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:07.160
I'm in a hurry.

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.080
Please—

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:08.880
Don't touch me!

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:14.810
Are you alright?

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:17.540
T-Thank you.

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:22.900
Here you go.

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.360
Sorry.

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:27.580
No worries.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:29.030
I can understand.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.240
Senpai!

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:35.410
Where did you go?

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:36.450
Hey, Mash.

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:39.790
I was looking for you.

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:45.250
Um, is something wrong?

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:46.590
No.

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:00.910
Hey!

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.870
We're almost there!

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:05.060
Hurry up! Hurry up!

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:08.140
Over here.

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:18.950
So, the Holy Grail is with King Arthur?

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:21.500
That's the problem.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:24.830
When King Arthur took over Jerusalem,

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:28.080
the Holy Grail may not have been there.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.160
Hmm, this sounds complicated.

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:35.010
Defeating King Arthur
may not solve this problem.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:37.250
That's not all.

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:41.120
According to rumors, somewhere
in the West, a man called the Sun-King

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:43.200
has set up a kingdom there.

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:48.690
If the Holy Grail isn't in the Holy City, there's a chance it's there instead.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:49.950
Yes.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.080
Anyway...

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:54.200
I plan to investigate the Holy City a bit more.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:55.750
Roger that.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:58.910
However, don't do
anything reckless, Leonardo.

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:02.000
I know.

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:04.960
Holy Selection?

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:06.370
Yes.

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.830
If you succeed in the monthly Holy Selection,

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:11.050
you can become a citizen of the Holy City.

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:14.700
If that happens, we can eat as much as we want!

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:16.010
Rushd.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.970
Our village...

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.770
incurred the wrath of gods and disappeared.

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:26.120
One day, out of the blue

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:29.370
a massive pillar of light shot down from the sky.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.440
Everything turned to ash.

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:41.250
Even outside the village,

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:43.250
there was nothing but the desert.

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:47.160
There's nowhere else for us to go but here.

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.200
You two.

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:22.450
Do you really think
they intend to save these people?

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:24.450
That's the purpose of this ceremony, right?

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:27.450
If they wanted to save the people.

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:29.920
Why not leave the gate open at all times?

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:44.540
Besides...

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:47.580
as for stories of people being saved in Jerusalem

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:49.230
I've heard none.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:55.540
I sense an unnatural number of Spirit Origins inside.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:59.950
If they want, they could wipe
everyone out in one fell swoop.

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:04.790
If that happens,
our priority should be to retreat.

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:06.540
Our opponents are the Knights of the Round Table.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.890
I don't see the possibility of us defeating them.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.000
I understand.

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:24.000
Welcome.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.850
Candidates of the Holy Selection.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:28.810
I am one of the Knights of the Round Table, Gawain.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:35.650
Our Holy City, Camelot is perfect.

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:36.910
Mash?
Our Holy City, Camelot is perfect.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.320
It's nothing.
A Millennial Kingdom of pure white.

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:38.450
It's nothing.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:39.320
I'm fine.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.290
Beyond these gates...

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:44.070
A Paradise awaits.

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:49.930
Let's appeal to the King's magnanimity.

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:09.000
Those who can be led to the farthest end are few.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.720
Humans are bound by the chains of fate.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:14.190
Thus, I will make this selection.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.160
Mom...

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:26.660
Souls that have not been tainted.

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:29.660
Souls uncorrupted by any and all wickedness.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:33.950
Humans born of eternal and immutable purity.

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:36.250
I extend an invitation only to these three.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:37.750
Go forth and collect them.

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:39.290
Sir Gawain.

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:44.010
Only three?

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:46.870
Everyone.

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.470
I'm afraid.

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:52.430
However, this too is necessary
to ensure mankind's continuity.

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:54.020
Right Now.

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:56.060
The Holy Selection starts.

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:14.290
This is bad.

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:15.540
We have no choice but to retreat.

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:16.290
Mash!

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:17.290
I'm leaving Fujimaru to you.

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:17.670
Yes!

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:23.970
Rushd!

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:28.160
Let me go!

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:29.870
You have been chosen.

00:17:29.870 --> 00:17:31.330
This is the way of the Holy City.

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:32.540
Ah, Rushd!

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:34.540
This child was not chosen.

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:37.330
Your very being no longer belongs to you.

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:39.000
I will serve the Lion King!

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:40.160
I'll do anything!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.330
So, please.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.860
Let this child come with me!

00:17:43.650 --> 00:17:44.830
Rushd!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:46.320
There are no exceptions.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:50.580
A pure soul is not allowed to enjoy the human's freedom.

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:01.000
Mother...?

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:03.340
Rushd...

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:06.910
Thank goodness.

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:08.390
My hope.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.260
My life.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:17.690
Mom...?

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:19.620
The vital signs has been stopped.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.580
Dropout of one candidate confirmed.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:23.400
To continue with the Holy Selection.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.610
Stop it!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:29.700
Senpai!

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:32.990
Rushd!

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:41.630
The enemy knight has been neutralized.

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:43.000
Let's go, Mash!

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:44.870
Yes.

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:46.280
That cannot be allowed.

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:49.330
Till the Holy Selection has ended.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:52.850
No matter who you are,
you cannot return to the life you've lived.

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:54.810
Get ready for it.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.500
This is...

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:10.750
Sir Gawain's...!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:11.950
The Knight of the Sun.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:13.910
Indeed.

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:16.160
As long as the sun shines.

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:18.660
My power receives the blessing from the saints.

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:22.000
You have no chance of winning.

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:24.000
Instead of escaping on your own...

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:27.500
You've entered the enemy territory to save a child.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.410
In the face of such a resolution...

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:30.680
I shall offer you a worthy battle!

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.160
Is that all you've got?

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:53.000
Not yet!

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.830
There's still more to the power I've been given!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:57.290
As long as you still hold that shield,

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:59.120
I have no choice but to give it my all.

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:04.630
This sword is a reflection of the sun.

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:07.960
It purifies all impurities.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.720
Haze of Flames!

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:10.760
Mash!

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:12.720
Lord Chaldeas!

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:17.060
Excalibur Galatine!

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:36.200
No way...

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:36.990
Why?

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:39.910
This massacre was under my orders.

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:41.160
Despite that,

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:43.580
you bear no hostility towards me.

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:48.050
For those who enter the battlefield without knowing their purpose.

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:50.700
Know that, it is an insult to us!

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:51.970
Why are you doing this?

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:55.790
We are guardians of the Millennial Kingdom.

00:20:55.790 --> 00:20:56.930
The Knights of the Round Table.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:21:02.390
We are chosen if the King sees us worthy
and those who aren't are annihilated.

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:04.140
That's all.

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:06.290
These people...

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:08.570
came here in hopes you would save them!

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:14.700
Aren't you the hopes of the people?

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:17.280
The Knights of the Round Table?!

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:21.250
In this desert, this hope is ridiculous.

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:22.960
It's fine if you call it arrogance.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:27.000
This is all for the survival of mankind.

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:30.620
For that cause, bloodshed is inevitable.

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:32.380
How can there be such a thing?!

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:35.340
Before you die, tell me who are you?

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:37.510
Master from another world.

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:41.390
Ritsuka Fujimaru!

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:43.700
Ritsuka Fujimaru.

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:45.000
You are very brave.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.440
But...

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:48.400
you lack experience.

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:53.160
Sir Gawain.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:54.150
That's it.

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:56.000
Impossible!

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:58.040
Why are you here?

00:21:58.040 --> 00:21:59.120
Bedivere!

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:01.410
As a Knight of the Round Table,

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:03.540
are you planning to rebel against our King?

00:22:03.540 --> 00:22:07.910
The reason we fight is for justice and humanity.

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:11.340
If the Knights of the Round Table have strayed from that path...

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:26.440
Switch on, Airgetlám!

00:22:27.370 --> 00:22:28.900
Galatine!

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:33.000
That is...

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:34.280
the light of a Divine Spirit.

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:51.130
Are you alright?

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:54.880
Get out of the way!

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:19.780
Fujimaru, hurry!

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:26.750
Bedivere...

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:30.420
Why have you appeared now?

00:23:35.870 --> 00:23:37.000
During the Holy Selection,

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:38.750
a disturbance occurred.

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:39.950
The refugees...

00:23:39.950 --> 00:23:42.010
have fled into the desert.

00:23:42.410 --> 00:23:45.540
My life is consecrated to you.

00:23:45.540 --> 00:23:47.600
Judge me as you see fit, my King.

00:23:49.500 --> 00:23:51.830
Well then, lift your head up, Gawain.

00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:53.540
On your knees, though.

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:01.990
You don't need to stand up anymore.

00:24:23.290 --> 00:24:24.950
Serves you well, Gawain.

00:24:24.950 --> 00:24:26.910
The sturdiest Knight of the Round Table.

00:24:26.910 --> 00:24:27.750
Listen well.

00:24:27.750 --> 00:24:29.080
Knights of the Round Table.

00:24:29.830 --> 00:24:32.750
I delivered him a fatal blow.

00:24:32.750 --> 00:24:37.280
However, his survival has
earned Gawain my mercy.

00:24:37.950 --> 00:24:39.570
Is there anyone who objects?

00:24:39.750 --> 00:24:40.580
No.

00:24:40.580 --> 00:24:42.780
Yes, it is as Father has decided.

00:24:55.500 --> 00:24:58.670
You really don't plan to pursue them?

00:24:58.790 --> 00:24:59.660
Of course.

00:24:59.660 --> 00:25:01.290
It is the King's decree.

00:25:01.290 --> 00:25:03.080
The Prophecy of the Stars...

00:25:03.080 --> 00:25:05.140
You haven't forgotten, have you?

00:25:06.250 --> 00:25:09.020
The master who came from another world, eh?

00:25:12.370 --> 00:25:13.790
It can't be avoided.

00:25:13.790 --> 00:25:15.940
Contact Sir Lancelot.

00:25:33.040 --> 00:25:34.420
King Arthur...

00:25:45.370 --> 00:25:46.300
Sir Tristan!

00:25:46.950 --> 00:25:48.050
Everyone!

00:25:51.000 --> 00:25:52.990
The King does not understand people's hearts.

00:25:53.660 --> 00:25:55.980
What are you saying, Sir Tristan?

00:25:56.410 --> 00:26:00.440
Didn't we vow to serve the King, together?

00:26:01.540 --> 00:26:04.200
I'm sorry about that, my comrade.

00:26:04.200 --> 00:26:06.160
I am deeply saddened.

00:26:13.370 --> 00:26:14.830
Out of my way!

00:26:16.950 --> 00:26:18.330
If it hadn't been you,

00:26:18.330 --> 00:26:20.040
Camelot would've...

00:26:21.580 --> 00:26:23.130
What are you doing?

00:26:23.700 --> 00:26:25.700
Our King is in danger!

00:26:25.700 --> 00:26:26.760
Bedivere...

00:26:29.450 --> 00:26:30.970
King Arthur...

00:26:35.830 --> 00:26:36.390
Why?

00:26:39.330 --> 00:26:42.370
Why wouldn't you end my life?

00:26:42.370 --> 00:26:43.480
Bedivere.

00:26:44.160 --> 00:26:44.860
I–

00:26:51.330 --> 00:26:53.120
I wonder if the rest managed to escape...

00:27:01.450 --> 00:27:03.000
Are you alright?

00:27:03.700 --> 00:27:04.840
This place is...

00:27:08.250 --> 00:27:10.260
Don't push yourself.

00:27:10.260 --> 00:27:12.720
You're lucky to be alive, after all.

00:27:14.200 --> 00:27:16.680
Everyone is safe, I presume?

00:27:17.000 --> 00:27:18.870
Thanks to your help, we were saved.

00:27:18.870 --> 00:27:19.870
Um...

00:27:19.870 --> 00:27:21.790
Sir Bedivere.

00:27:21.790 --> 00:27:25.000
King Arthur's final companion who witnessed her death

00:27:25.000 --> 00:27:26.830
and the one of the Knights of the Round Table...

00:27:26.830 --> 00:27:28.610
who returned the Holy Sword Excalibur to the lake.

00:27:29.540 --> 00:27:31.450
He's also an excellent Servant.

00:27:33.040 --> 00:27:34.620
I hope you don't mind me asking.

00:27:35.330 --> 00:27:37.370
Despite being a Knight of the Round Table,

00:27:37.370 --> 00:27:39.000
why did you...?

00:27:40.160 --> 00:27:41.420
I...

00:27:42.120 --> 00:27:45.080
joined the Knights at the last minute.

00:27:45.080 --> 00:27:48.830
My comrade Knights and I
were summoned separately.

00:27:48.830 --> 00:27:51.330
When I finally arrived at this land...

00:27:51.330 --> 00:27:53.580
So that's how it was.

00:27:53.580 --> 00:27:55.640
You couldn't help but be surprised.

00:27:56.290 --> 00:27:57.830
It's tough to admit,

00:27:57.830 --> 00:28:00.080
but the current Round Table is wrong.

00:28:00.080 --> 00:28:02.860
So I must stop the King, no matter what.

00:28:03.450 --> 00:28:06.790
Even from your perspective,
King Arthur was acting weird?

00:28:06.790 --> 00:28:07.620
If that's the case–

00:28:07.620 --> 00:28:08.490
Please wait!

00:28:09.330 --> 00:28:10.200
Something is coming.

00:28:20.750 --> 00:28:21.580
Pursuers!

00:28:25.870 --> 00:28:27.250
That flag!

00:28:27.250 --> 00:28:28.660
Knight of the Lake.

00:28:28.660 --> 00:28:29.920
Sir Lancelot.

00:28:45.370 --> 00:28:47.480
Arondight!

00:28:47.790 --> 00:28:49.330
As expected.

00:28:49.330 --> 00:28:50.400
This is bad.

00:28:51.160 --> 00:28:53.200
Escape would be possible if it was just us,

00:28:53.200 --> 00:28:55.370
but with the refugees,
we can't outrun them.

00:28:55.370 --> 00:28:55.950
Mash!

00:28:55.950 --> 00:28:56.750
Everyone!

00:28:56.750 --> 00:28:57.540
Please wait.

00:28:57.540 --> 00:29:00.500
You're no match for Sir Lancelot.

00:29:00.500 --> 00:29:01.250
I will–

00:29:01.250 --> 00:29:02.290
Hey, hey.

00:29:02.290 --> 00:29:03.540
In your condition,

00:29:03.540 --> 00:29:04.660
that doesn't sound convincing.

00:29:04.660 --> 00:29:05.210
But...

00:29:07.830 --> 00:29:10.050
I really didn't want to use this.

00:29:13.410 --> 00:29:14.720
Da Vinci...

00:29:22.500 --> 00:29:23.650
Don't tell me.

00:29:24.830 --> 00:29:25.980
Stop it!

00:29:29.120 --> 00:29:31.700
This is where the genius takes the stage.

00:29:32.290 --> 00:29:34.250
It was an honour to accompany you.

00:29:34.250 --> 00:29:36.290
Don't do it, Da Vinci!

00:29:36.290 --> 00:29:37.250
Hey, hey.

00:29:37.250 --> 00:29:40.290
Servants are really disposables you can use

00:29:40.290 --> 00:29:41.750
and discard after a day or two.

00:29:42.290 --> 00:29:42.870
No way!

00:29:42.870 --> 00:29:46.000
I got to hang around a little longer than the others.

00:29:46.750 --> 00:29:47.960
Or perhaps.

00:29:48.370 --> 00:29:50.380
I've stayed for too long already.

00:29:55.160 --> 00:29:56.160
Listen.

00:29:56.160 --> 00:29:58.660
Stay on this path and continue into the desert.

00:29:58.660 --> 00:30:00.430
You'll find the Sun-King there.

00:30:01.120 --> 00:30:02.500
If all goes well,

00:30:02.500 --> 00:30:03.770
you should be able to gain his cooperation.

00:30:04.700 --> 00:30:05.480
Step back!

00:30:06.660 --> 00:30:08.370
If it's you, I'm sure it's possible.

00:30:08.370 --> 00:30:09.570
Even after this...

00:30:18.080 --> 00:30:19.700
Ci vediamo, my friends!

00:30:19.700 --> 00:30:21.200
This genius is indestructible!

00:30:21.500 --> 00:30:22.450
If we survive,

00:30:22.450 --> 00:30:23.660
we'll definitely meet again!

00:31:19.370 --> 00:31:20.750
Master.

00:31:20.750 --> 00:31:22.430
Da Vinci is...

00:31:23.620 --> 00:31:25.060
We can escape now.

00:31:25.750 --> 00:31:28.250
Let's head into the Sun-King's desert.

00:31:28.250 --> 00:31:29.730
But...

00:31:35.330 --> 00:31:36.900
Let's go, Mash.

00:31:55.080 --> 00:31:57.120
Ritsuka Fujimaru.

00:31:57.120 --> 00:31:58.300
Who are you?

00:32:18.250 --> 00:32:21.590
Just a little longer than the others, huh?

00:32:22.160 --> 00:32:25.120
Indeed, that's Leonardo for you.

00:32:25.120 --> 00:32:27.400
I'm sorry, Doctor.

00:32:28.120 --> 00:32:30.410
Your opponent was the indomitable

00:32:30.410 --> 00:32:32.040
Lord Lancelot of the Round Table.

00:32:32.040 --> 00:32:35.840
Da Vinci's call was the right one.

00:32:36.620 --> 00:32:37.830
But...

00:32:37.830 --> 00:32:40.000
Don't dwell on it.

00:32:40.000 --> 00:32:41.580
It's Da Vinci after all.

00:32:41.580 --> 00:32:44.970
Certainly, trying to stop her is useless.

00:32:46.290 --> 00:32:47.700
Mash?

00:32:47.700 --> 00:32:49.080
Doctor.

00:32:49.080 --> 00:32:50.450
I think...

00:32:50.450 --> 00:32:52.400
I should be more furious.

00:32:52.910 --> 00:32:55.250
Despite witnessing the tragedy,

00:32:55.250 --> 00:32:56.620
even so,

00:32:56.620 --> 00:32:57.790
no matter what,

00:32:58.450 --> 00:33:02.740
I can't seem to feel hatred
towards the Knights of the Round Table.

00:33:04.080 --> 00:33:05.290
Hmm.

00:33:05.290 --> 00:33:08.330
To be able to understand the
enemy is already well enough.

00:33:08.330 --> 00:33:10.040
No need to force yourself to hate them.

00:33:12.620 --> 00:33:13.290
Thank you...

00:33:13.290 --> 00:33:15.040
very much.

00:33:17.250 --> 00:33:17.960
Wanna eat?

00:33:22.040 --> 00:33:23.970
I see.

00:33:31.450 --> 00:33:33.620
The Knights of the Round Table...

00:33:33.620 --> 00:33:36.900
They're different from what I imagined.

00:33:37.750 --> 00:33:39.080
Sir Bedivere.

00:33:39.080 --> 00:33:40.440
What do you plan to do now?

00:33:42.120 --> 00:33:44.000
I...

00:33:44.000 --> 00:33:46.290
want to meet the King.

00:33:46.290 --> 00:33:48.660
I wanna know his true intentions

00:33:48.660 --> 00:33:51.200
and stop this madness.

00:33:52.500 --> 00:33:53.370
If that's the case,

00:33:54.410 --> 00:33:56.080
shall we go together?

00:33:57.000 --> 00:33:58.630
Why?

00:33:59.400 --> 00:34:01.830
If the Lion King is not stopped,

00:34:01.830 --> 00:34:03.930
this world will only become worse.

00:34:04.900 --> 00:34:09.350
Therefore, please lend me your strength.

00:34:54.790 --> 00:34:55.980
No.

00:34:56.410 --> 00:34:58.040
I can't go on any further...

00:34:58.040 --> 00:34:58.980
Hang in there!

00:34:59.700 --> 00:35:01.200
Just a little further...

00:35:01.200 --> 00:35:02.440
Just a little further and we'll be there soon.

00:35:03.580 --> 00:35:04.580
Be silent.

00:35:22.410 --> 00:35:24.880
For your own sake, please do not resist.

00:35:29.330 --> 00:35:31.700
I am Nitocris.

00:35:31.700 --> 00:35:33.660
A Servant summoned alongside

00:35:33.660 --> 00:35:35.720
the Sun-King to this land.

00:35:36.250 --> 00:35:37.700
Did you knowingly trespass

00:35:37.700 --> 00:35:39.850
into the land of the Sun-King?

00:35:40.500 --> 00:35:42.150
The Sun-King...

00:35:45.120 --> 00:35:47.410
We were pursued by people of the Holy City!

00:35:47.410 --> 00:35:48.870
Please save us!

00:35:48.870 --> 00:35:50.700
We've run out of food and water!

00:35:53.790 --> 00:35:56.160
We will take you in.

00:35:56.580 --> 00:35:59.290
Let us discuss further about it in the town.

00:35:59.290 --> 00:36:00.700
Will it be alright?

00:36:00.700 --> 00:36:01.700
Thank goodness.

00:36:01.700 --> 00:36:02.700
Take us in?

00:36:02.700 --> 00:36:03.540
They're willing to listen.

00:36:03.540 --> 00:36:05.210
Are they willing to accept us?

00:36:05.580 --> 00:36:08.290
That is for my King to decide.

00:36:08.290 --> 00:36:09.290
Come along.

00:36:14.580 --> 00:36:15.810
Wake up!

00:36:16.330 --> 00:36:17.140
That's rude!

00:36:27.410 --> 00:36:30.950
Is it really safe to follow her?

00:36:30.950 --> 00:36:33.950
Well, she doesn't seem like a bad person.

00:36:33.950 --> 00:36:34.950
Let's go.

00:37:02.830 --> 00:37:03.660
Amazing!

00:37:03.660 --> 00:37:06.400
To think such a place still existed...

00:37:07.330 --> 00:37:10.000
We, who wandered the desert

00:37:10.000 --> 00:37:12.830
were accepted by our King.

00:37:12.830 --> 00:37:16.250
This place is the last and only remaining

00:37:16.250 --> 00:37:18.700
utopia in this world.

00:37:19.500 --> 00:37:21.660
He sounds like a good King.

00:37:22.080 --> 00:37:23.540
Of course!

00:37:24.250 --> 00:37:25.950
Thanks to the Pharaoh's power,

00:37:25.950 --> 00:37:33.050
every glory of Nile, from the first dynasty to the end of time resides in this land.

00:37:33.910 --> 00:37:34.910
In other words,

00:37:35.620 --> 00:37:39.600
the Sun-King summoned the
promised land of Canaan here?

00:37:39.870 --> 00:37:40.870
Exactly!

00:37:41.620 --> 00:37:42.640
And!

00:37:42.950 --> 00:37:45.620
That's where our Pharaoh resides.

00:37:46.290 --> 00:37:49.110
The Ramesseum Tentyris!

00:37:54.580 --> 00:37:57.750
Nitocris is legendary Egyptian sorceress queen

00:37:57.750 --> 00:37:59.120
from the 6th Dynasty.

00:37:59.910 --> 00:38:00.910
And...

00:38:00.910 --> 00:38:03.910
Ramesseum Tentyris is Egypt's

00:38:03.910 --> 00:38:05.500
19th Dynasty's Pharaoh,

00:38:05.500 --> 00:38:08.000
also known as Ramesess the Second.

00:38:08.500 --> 00:38:09.620
That means,

00:38:09.620 --> 00:38:11.590
he's a figure from the 14th century B.C.

00:38:12.290 --> 00:38:13.290
In the future,

00:38:13.290 --> 00:38:15.910
he came to be known as the
King that manifests the truth of the Sun,

00:38:15.910 --> 00:38:18.630
Ozymandias.

00:38:19.330 --> 00:38:20.950
Be careful.

00:38:20.950 --> 00:38:23.790
If it truly is King Ozymandias,

00:38:23.790 --> 00:38:25.950
he's a Heroic Spirit

00:38:25.950 --> 00:38:27.830
whose power is on par with King Arthur.

00:38:27.830 --> 00:38:29.440
Frankly speaking, there's no prevailing against him.

00:38:45.700 --> 00:38:47.570
Ozymandias...

00:39:04.080 --> 00:39:05.450
Behold!

00:39:05.450 --> 00:39:06.750
The most courageous,

00:39:06.750 --> 00:39:09.660
The most majestic god,

00:39:09.660 --> 00:39:12.000
and also our greatest Pharaoh,

00:39:12.000 --> 00:39:14.790
The Sun-King, Ozymandias!

00:39:14.790 --> 00:39:16.830
His majesty is here to save us

00:39:16.830 --> 00:39:19.910
from the apocalypse!

00:39:21.330 --> 00:39:22.580
Hmph.

00:39:22.580 --> 00:39:25.370
So you are humanity's final Master?

00:39:26.500 --> 00:39:28.330
I am Ritsuka Fujimaru!

00:39:28.330 --> 00:39:30.700
We came to this singularity

00:39:30.700 --> 00:39:32.000
to correct distortions in human history.

00:39:32.000 --> 00:39:33.050
It's pointless!

00:39:36.040 --> 00:39:38.290
I have manifested here

00:39:38.290 --> 00:39:40.000
as the one true Pharaoh.

00:39:40.000 --> 00:39:42.450
My domain lies here.

00:39:42.450 --> 00:39:45.750
You could say that humanity has already been saved.

00:39:45.750 --> 00:39:47.330
That's wrong.

00:39:47.330 --> 00:39:49.910
Every single era has been destroyed by Solomon,

00:39:49.910 --> 00:39:51.230
the King of Mages.

00:39:51.450 --> 00:39:54.040
At this rate, even this era will...

00:39:54.040 --> 00:39:55.920
The King of Mages, huh?

00:39:57.200 --> 00:39:58.360
That's not enough to scare me.

00:39:59.830 --> 00:40:01.200
The Holy Grail?

00:40:01.200 --> 00:40:02.120
Indeed.

00:40:03.540 --> 00:40:07.290
I took it from the foolish Crusaders.

00:40:07.290 --> 00:40:09.750
With my power and that of the Holy Grail combined,

00:40:09.750 --> 00:40:12.160
even if the world is going to be destroyed,

00:40:12.160 --> 00:40:14.550
my kingdom shall remain indestructible.

00:40:19.660 --> 00:40:22.000
You desire this, don't you?

00:40:22.000 --> 00:40:24.200
Would you like to take it by force?

00:40:24.500 --> 00:40:25.720
I will consider you an enemy then.

00:40:34.580 --> 00:40:37.580
You have no other option.

00:40:37.580 --> 00:40:39.490
Kneel and swear your loyalty to me.

00:40:41.410 --> 00:40:44.830
You may live on as my slaves.

00:40:44.830 --> 00:40:45.790
No way...

00:40:45.790 --> 00:40:47.000
Become slaves?

00:40:47.540 --> 00:40:49.540
H-Hold on.

00:40:49.540 --> 00:40:52.710
We did not come here to be your slaves.

00:40:54.370 --> 00:40:55.750
Not satisfied?

00:40:57.080 --> 00:40:58.720
Then—

00:41:05.000 --> 00:41:07.040
Caster.

00:41:07.040 --> 00:41:07.930
Pharaoh.

00:41:08.830 --> 00:41:14.440
Perhaps these people need
some time to think and consider.

00:41:14.870 --> 00:41:18.160
You really enjoy meddling in other people's business,

00:41:18.160 --> 00:41:19.320
don't you?

00:41:19.580 --> 00:41:22.450
Well, that's my job, after all.

00:41:22.870 --> 00:41:24.500
I have a favour to ask you,

00:41:24.500 --> 00:41:25.410
O Pharaoh.

00:41:25.410 --> 00:41:29.290
The refugees are injured
and there are children as well.

00:41:33.620 --> 00:41:37.050
I am as magnanimous as the Sun!

00:41:37.750 --> 00:41:42.340
Enjoy my kingdom's greatness with your whole being.

00:41:57.540 --> 00:41:59.040
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:41:59.040 --> 00:42:00.040
Here you go.

00:42:00.040 --> 00:42:01.450
Thank you very much.

00:42:01.450 --> 00:42:02.700
Thank you for the meal.

00:42:05.410 --> 00:42:06.490
Delicious!

00:42:39.330 --> 00:42:40.070
You too, Bedivere.

00:42:42.250 --> 00:42:45.410
Even though Servants don't really need food.

00:42:45.410 --> 00:42:45.990
No.

00:42:46.700 --> 00:42:48.000
Thank you.

00:42:48.000 --> 00:42:49.450
Fujimaru.

00:42:57.370 --> 00:42:58.380
As I suspected.

00:43:01.410 --> 00:43:03.670
On the surface, this place looks lively.

00:43:04.700 --> 00:43:06.580
There's little manpower

00:43:06.580 --> 00:43:09.610
and they can only harvest wheat.

00:43:10.540 --> 00:43:13.980
This place is not sustainable.

00:43:14.870 --> 00:43:16.700
However...

00:43:16.700 --> 00:43:19.560
it's a fact that there's no place better than here.

00:43:19.950 --> 00:43:21.500
No matter what,

00:43:21.500 --> 00:43:24.570
we need King Ozymandias' aid.

00:43:25.250 --> 00:43:27.040
To fight the Holy City,

00:43:27.040 --> 00:43:29.000
there's no other way.

00:43:37.250 --> 00:43:39.080
Come here, please.

00:43:47.620 --> 00:43:49.830
You are an enigma, right?

00:43:50.540 --> 00:43:51.870
While you have a similar

00:43:51.870 --> 00:43:53.350
smell to us Servants,

00:43:53.350 --> 00:43:53.540
I think it's just a little bit.
smell to us Servants,

00:43:53.540 --> 00:43:54.060
something is different.
I think it's just a little bit.

00:43:54.060 --> 00:43:55.140
something is different.

00:43:57.580 --> 00:43:59.060
I am...

00:43:59.790 --> 00:44:01.540
a human being created to be

00:44:01.540 --> 00:44:03.500
a Heroic Spirit's soul's prime vessel.

00:44:04.030 --> 00:44:05.030
A Heroic Spirit?

00:44:07.790 --> 00:44:08.790
But...

00:44:08.790 --> 00:44:11.870
the identity of the Heroic Spirit slumbering within me,

00:44:11.870 --> 00:44:13.700
I have no idea about it.

00:44:14.330 --> 00:44:16.040
This power.

00:44:16.040 --> 00:44:17.660
How do I use it?

00:44:19.410 --> 00:44:22.120
That's why, back in the Holy City,

00:44:22.120 --> 00:44:24.130
I let so many people die.

00:44:29.750 --> 00:44:31.970
You did well.

00:44:33.330 --> 00:44:35.950
Humans cannot become gods.

00:44:35.950 --> 00:44:38.950
Saving everything is impossible,

00:44:38.950 --> 00:44:42.080
even for our great Pharaoh.

00:44:42.080 --> 00:44:43.370
Is it...

00:44:43.370 --> 00:44:44.770
the same for this place as well?

00:44:47.830 --> 00:44:51.530
Our King is giving it his all.

00:44:59.120 --> 00:45:00.910
Have you made up your mind of submitting to me,

00:45:00.910 --> 00:45:02.460
Ritsuka Fujimaru?

00:45:05.370 --> 00:45:07.290
I am still confused.

00:45:07.290 --> 00:45:10.700
Unsure of which path to take?

00:45:10.700 --> 00:45:11.510
Yes.

00:45:14.200 --> 00:45:15.200
But...

00:45:15.200 --> 00:45:17.600
I think that only destruction awaits even if I do stay here.

00:45:19.660 --> 00:45:21.390
Nothing will change.

00:45:22.160 --> 00:45:23.900
Why do you think so?

00:45:25.700 --> 00:45:27.450
I saw the town.

00:45:27.450 --> 00:45:29.450
It is a wonderful town.

00:45:29.450 --> 00:45:32.070
Rushd and the others will be able to live here.

00:45:32.660 --> 00:45:33.370
But...

00:45:33.370 --> 00:45:36.330
won't this land eventually be swallowed by the desert?

00:45:36.330 --> 00:45:38.950
But that time is not now!

00:45:38.950 --> 00:45:40.700
Until the very end,

00:45:40.700 --> 00:45:42.620
I will resist destruction.

00:45:42.620 --> 00:45:45.670
I have no intention of letting the Holy City as it is.

00:45:46.370 --> 00:45:47.910
What do you plan to do?

00:45:47.910 --> 00:45:49.920
Ritsuka Fujimaru.

00:45:54.700 --> 00:45:55.970
I don't know.

00:45:57.830 --> 00:45:58.870
But...

00:45:58.870 --> 00:46:00.950
I refuse to give up.

00:46:00.950 --> 00:46:02.910
Until the very end!

00:46:02.910 --> 00:46:04.450
That's why...

00:46:04.450 --> 00:46:06.310
I am not going to serve you!

00:46:09.580 --> 00:46:10.730
You got balls!

00:46:11.500 --> 00:46:13.990
In that case, begone from my sight now!

00:46:13.990 --> 00:46:15.620
Those who don't serve me

00:46:15.620 --> 00:46:16.820
have no place here!

00:46:18.040 --> 00:46:22.020
You will regret your foolishness as you rot in the ground!

00:46:24.500 --> 00:46:26.200
However...

00:46:26.200 --> 00:46:30.790
for you to die a dog's death would be a shame.

00:46:30.790 --> 00:46:33.800
Remember my generosity well.

00:46:34.330 --> 00:46:37.120
Make use of the Caster over there as your guardian.

00:46:37.120 --> 00:46:37.840
Eh?

00:46:41.950 --> 00:46:42.950
Well...

00:46:42.950 --> 00:46:43.910
Why not?

00:46:43.910 --> 00:46:46.750
A meeting by chance is
but a connection made in a past life.

00:46:46.750 --> 00:46:47.540
Pharaoh.

00:46:47.540 --> 00:46:48.830
It's been great!

00:46:54.160 --> 00:46:55.870
I'll leave Rushd and the others in your care.

00:46:55.870 --> 00:46:57.110
Thank you.

00:47:04.250 --> 00:47:05.370
Know this!

00:47:05.370 --> 00:47:08.500
Do not expect mercy from me a second time!

00:47:08.500 --> 00:47:10.790
Go forth and show them

00:47:10.790 --> 00:47:12.960
that resolve!

00:47:27.660 --> 00:47:30.020
Well then, I'll be in your care from now on.

00:47:30.020 --> 00:47:31.290
Yes.

00:47:31.290 --> 00:47:32.120
So...

00:47:32.120 --> 00:47:34.230
where do you plan to go now?

00:47:35.040 --> 00:47:36.900
You see...

00:47:37.200 --> 00:47:40.030
I don't really have a destination in mind.

00:47:41.160 --> 00:47:43.950
I thought you had one in mind, Senpai.

00:47:53.330 --> 00:47:56.370
Hey!

00:47:56.370 --> 00:47:58.550
Wait for us!

00:47:59.000 --> 00:48:00.510
Rushd!

00:48:05.000 --> 00:48:06.120
Everyone...

00:48:06.120 --> 00:48:07.230
But why?

00:48:08.200 --> 00:48:11.370
Our people have been massacred.

00:48:11.370 --> 00:48:13.690
Your wish to fight the Lion King is the same as ours!

00:48:16.330 --> 00:48:18.030
It will be an tough journey.

00:48:30.620 --> 00:48:31.460
Mother said that...

00:48:31.800 --> 00:48:35.670
during times of imminent danger,
this pendant will help me.

00:48:47.560 --> 00:48:48.600
Senpai!

00:49:02.950 --> 00:49:04.030
It's a map.

00:49:05.250 --> 00:49:06.540
From what I can see,

00:49:06.540 --> 00:49:08.750
it points towards the mountains in the north-east.

00:49:09.250 --> 00:49:12.870
Mother said that this pendant was given to her in a village

00:49:12.870 --> 00:49:15.210
of people who refuse to serve anyone.

00:49:16.000 --> 00:49:18.830
A third powerhouse?

00:49:18.830 --> 00:49:21.130
Seems worth a shot.

00:51:03.500 --> 00:51:05.740
Are you thinking about the Lion King?

00:51:06.660 --> 00:51:07.660
Yes.

00:51:11.250 --> 00:51:13.200
What a horrible King.

00:51:14.000 --> 00:51:15.290
No.

00:51:15.290 --> 00:51:16.710
She was a great King.

00:51:18.040 --> 00:51:19.200
During her time,

00:51:19.200 --> 00:51:21.830
she built the White Castle of Camelot,

00:51:21.830 --> 00:51:23.410
fought against invaders

00:51:23.410 --> 00:51:25.340
and brought peace to the people.

00:51:26.290 --> 00:51:27.500
Also...

00:51:27.500 --> 00:51:31.050
she kept a worthless Knight like me by her side.

00:51:32.750 --> 00:51:35.580
She cares and empathizes deeply with people,

00:51:35.580 --> 00:51:37.940
down to the tiniest details of their lives.

00:51:41.660 --> 00:51:44.480
Why would you fight a person like her?

00:51:49.200 --> 00:51:50.450
That's exactly why...

00:51:50.910 --> 00:51:54.040
I need to stop her.

00:52:04.620 --> 00:52:06.300
O King of Knights.

00:53:02.040 --> 00:53:04.290
It really exists, Senpai.

00:53:04.290 --> 00:53:05.000
Yes.

00:53:05.000 --> 00:53:06.450
I can't anymore.

00:53:06.450 --> 00:53:09.030
Can you please carry me on your back?

00:53:11.790 --> 00:53:16.370
I thought something was off
but to think there were Servants here.

00:53:17.410 --> 00:53:20.000
This is not a place for you to be.

00:53:20.580 --> 00:53:21.290
Hold on!

00:53:21.830 --> 00:53:25.830
That knight over there is one of  the Knight of the Round Table.

00:53:25.830 --> 00:53:27.960
He is not an ally of the Round Table!

00:53:28.620 --> 00:53:31.930
Is there anything which can prove that statement?

00:53:32.450 --> 00:53:34.450
Now that you've seen our hidden village,

00:53:34.450 --> 00:53:35.580
I can't let you leave alive.

00:53:36.950 --> 00:53:40.390
These people fought the
Round Table for our sakes!

00:53:40.620 --> 00:53:41.620
It's true!

00:53:47.040 --> 00:53:49.580
That act itself could have been a trap.

00:53:49.580 --> 00:53:52.660
To escape the Round Table is almost unbelievable.

00:53:52.660 --> 00:53:53.660
Cursed Arm.

00:53:54.580 --> 00:53:57.620
That child speaks the truth.

00:53:57.620 --> 00:53:58.700
Yo!

00:53:58.700 --> 00:53:59.950
We met again, Lucius.

00:54:02.120 --> 00:54:04.670
That's a nice expression you have now.

00:54:11.580 --> 00:54:13.160
The Holy City...

00:54:13.160 --> 00:54:13.950
and the Lion King.

00:54:13.950 --> 00:54:16.040
You fought them, right?

00:54:16.040 --> 00:54:18.700
You, who were once part of the Round Table.

00:54:18.700 --> 00:54:21.270
I can't let that person remain as she is now.

00:54:24.040 --> 00:54:25.370
Even if it's just for a while,

00:54:25.370 --> 00:54:28.700
would it be possible for us to stay here?

00:54:28.700 --> 00:54:29.700
Cursed Arm.

00:54:30.500 --> 00:54:33.030
I can vouch for these people.

00:54:34.540 --> 00:54:36.950
If Arash says so.

00:54:38.660 --> 00:54:41.660
Allow me to introduce myself again.

00:54:41.660 --> 00:54:43.250
Arash Kamangir.

00:54:43.250 --> 00:54:44.250
As you can see,

00:54:44.250 --> 00:54:44.870
I'm an Archer.

00:54:48.250 --> 00:54:49.410
Arash...

00:54:49.410 --> 00:54:51.000
Kamangir.

00:54:51.450 --> 00:54:53.370
I lied about my name back then.

00:54:53.370 --> 00:54:55.250
My apologies.

00:54:55.250 --> 00:54:57.250
My name is Bedivere.

00:54:57.250 --> 00:54:57.950
Ok.

00:54:57.950 --> 00:54:59.470
Nice to meet you.

00:55:00.080 --> 00:55:02.250
This is Cursed Arm Hassan.

00:55:02.250 --> 00:55:03.810
He is the village chief.

00:55:04.580 --> 00:55:06.980
Forgive my rudeness earlier.

00:55:08.450 --> 00:55:10.000
In this village,

00:55:10.000 --> 00:55:12.200
various types of people have gathered.

00:55:13.200 --> 00:55:16.910
They are people who refuse to serve both the Lion King and the Sun-King.

00:55:18.330 --> 00:55:21.450
Please, get some rest after your tiring journey.

00:55:21.450 --> 00:55:23.500
Fortunately, there are still empty houses.

00:55:23.500 --> 00:55:26.080
Feel free to use them.

00:55:30.330 --> 00:55:31.590
Boy.

00:55:32.370 --> 00:55:34.250
You...

00:55:34.250 --> 00:55:35.800
What happened to your mother?

00:55:40.250 --> 00:55:42.250
She was killed...

00:55:42.250 --> 00:55:44.770
by the ones in the Holy City.

00:55:48.120 --> 00:55:49.120
I see.

00:55:53.200 --> 00:55:54.080
Ah, wait.

00:55:54.080 --> 00:55:55.080
Hmm?

00:55:57.790 --> 00:55:58.910
This...

00:55:59.370 --> 00:56:00.410
Oh.

00:56:00.410 --> 00:56:02.750
Did you bring it out of honour?

00:56:02.750 --> 00:56:03.910
Back then.

00:56:03.910 --> 00:56:05.330
Thank you.

00:56:05.700 --> 00:56:07.080
Right back at you.

00:56:07.540 --> 00:56:10.080
I also used you for my own reasons.

00:56:10.080 --> 00:56:10.830
But...

00:56:11.370 --> 00:56:13.410
If you had not helped us,

00:56:13.410 --> 00:56:15.300
all of us would be dead.

00:56:17.410 --> 00:56:18.700
How sincere.

00:56:18.700 --> 00:56:19.830
Keep it.

00:56:19.830 --> 00:56:22.080
That's a knife I made for my protection.

00:56:25.200 --> 00:56:26.540
By the way,

00:56:27.580 --> 00:56:28.950
Those who don't work

00:56:28.950 --> 00:56:31.230
don't get to eat.

00:56:34.750 --> 00:56:36.870
Regarding Arash Kamangir,

00:56:36.870 --> 00:56:39.110
he is a legendary Persian hero.

00:56:39.620 --> 00:56:42.370
It is said that an arrow shot at the cost of his life

00:56:42.370 --> 00:56:47.040
ended a war that was raging for 60 years.

00:56:48.510 --> 00:56:49.590
That arm...

00:56:50.210 --> 00:56:52.500
Only a few swings left, huh?

00:56:54.000 --> 00:56:56.080
This is called Clairvoyance.

00:56:56.080 --> 00:56:57.550
It lets me see all sorts of things.

00:56:58.870 --> 00:57:02.430
That injury, it seems like
you haven't told the others as well.

00:57:07.700 --> 00:57:11.000
The burden you carry is too heavy.

00:57:11.000 --> 00:57:14.170
What an exemplary sense of chivalry.

00:57:16.200 --> 00:57:17.580
I...

00:57:17.580 --> 00:57:19.320
left that child's mother to her fate.

00:57:20.250 --> 00:57:22.360
I am a disgrace to Knights.

00:57:23.370 --> 00:57:24.660
Unlike you,

00:57:24.660 --> 00:57:28.360
I don't have the resolve for self-sacrifice.

00:57:28.830 --> 00:57:29.500
Chivalry is–

00:57:29.500 --> 00:57:33.040
Self-sacrifice is not something to be idolized.

00:57:33.040 --> 00:57:35.380
Why do you know my name in the first place?

00:57:36.950 --> 00:57:39.190
It's because our lives are connected.

00:57:41.160 --> 00:57:43.800
Stop shouldering your burdens alone, will you?

00:57:50.200 --> 00:57:52.000
Looks like they need help!

00:57:52.000 --> 00:57:53.000
Let's go!

00:58:12.700 --> 00:58:13.700
Amazing...

00:58:17.290 --> 00:58:18.340
Bedivere.

00:58:25.290 --> 00:58:27.330
It's falafel made out of chickpeas.

00:58:27.330 --> 00:58:28.330
It's good.

00:59:03.080 --> 00:59:05.620
The Lion King is planning
something in the Holy City.

00:59:07.700 --> 00:59:10.500
Perhaps the Round Table's inactivity...

00:59:10.500 --> 00:59:12.620
is due to the very same reason.

00:59:12.620 --> 00:59:15.330
These guys appearing now.

00:59:15.330 --> 00:59:17.980
Maybe they're the ones prophesied by fate.

00:59:19.370 --> 00:59:21.790
A person's fate...

00:59:21.790 --> 00:59:25.990
is under the governance of the one with the all-encompassing light.

00:59:27.120 --> 00:59:30.240
I am sorely aware of that fact.

00:59:34.950 --> 00:59:36.160
Tomorrow.

00:59:36.500 --> 00:59:40.000
Can you bring them over to my place?

00:59:41.250 --> 00:59:42.250
Sure.

00:59:55.870 --> 00:59:58.620
We have all made our decisions.

00:59:59.620 --> 01:00:01.040
Fujimaru.

01:00:01.040 --> 01:00:04.110
We would like to fight the Holy City with you.

01:00:05.160 --> 01:00:06.830
At this rate,

01:00:06.830 --> 01:00:10.030
we will eventually be wiped out by the Lion King's army.

01:00:11.500 --> 01:00:14.540
Your appearance this time

01:00:14.540 --> 01:00:16.410
must be fate extending it's helping hand.

01:00:16.410 --> 01:00:18.420
Please accept our humble request.

01:00:18.420 --> 01:00:19.410
I beg of you.

01:00:19.410 --> 01:00:20.830
Stop it, please!

01:00:20.830 --> 01:00:22.920
We are the ones seeking help!

01:00:23.830 --> 01:00:26.880
Let's beat the Lion King, together!

01:00:29.410 --> 01:00:30.830
Cursed Arm.

01:00:30.830 --> 01:00:32.720
Do you have a plan in mind?

01:00:33.160 --> 01:00:34.160
Yes.

01:00:36.250 --> 01:00:40.650
This Shrine of Azrael is our village's holy ground.

01:00:42.950 --> 01:00:44.540
Furthermore,

01:00:44.540 --> 01:00:47.040
in the depths of this Holy Shrine...

01:00:47.040 --> 01:00:50.320
our ancestor, Hassan-i-Sabbah...

01:00:51.040 --> 01:00:54.160
the Old Man of the Mountain, sleeps.

01:00:54.410 --> 01:00:56.500
The very first Assassin...

01:00:56.500 --> 01:00:58.370
He really exists...

01:00:58.790 --> 01:01:00.160
At first...

01:01:00.160 --> 01:01:03.840
he refused to meddle in human affairs.

01:01:04.080 --> 01:01:08.620
That is why we refrained from using his power.

01:01:08.620 --> 01:01:10.120
However...

01:01:10.120 --> 01:01:12.660
since you've appeared to us,

01:01:12.660 --> 01:01:14.680
we've strengthened our resolve.

01:01:15.580 --> 01:01:18.640
This must be a sign from the heavens.

01:01:19.440 --> 01:01:20.140
Cursed Arm!

01:01:20.580 --> 01:01:21.860
The west village was attacked!

01:01:24.450 --> 01:01:25.950
What happened to Serenity?

01:01:25.950 --> 01:01:28.540
She was taken to their fort.

01:01:28.540 --> 01:01:30.250
Serenity?

01:01:30.250 --> 01:01:32.080
Hassan of Serenity.

01:01:32.080 --> 01:01:35.040
The Assassin who protects the west village.

01:01:35.040 --> 01:01:38.000
We must find a way to rescue her!

01:01:38.700 --> 01:01:40.410
We'll go!

01:01:40.410 --> 01:01:41.580
Please entrust this to us!

01:01:42.540 --> 01:01:45.040
Arash, I leave the village to you.

01:01:45.040 --> 01:01:46.080
Right.

01:01:46.080 --> 01:01:47.800
I will serve as their guide.

01:02:57.700 --> 01:03:00.250
What are you doing here?

01:03:00.250 --> 01:03:01.370
Sir Mordred!

01:03:04.450 --> 01:03:05.830
Everyone, please go!

01:03:06.910 --> 01:03:08.000
Don't make me laugh!

01:03:11.510 --> 01:03:14.160
How dare you collude with these rebels?

01:03:14.160 --> 01:03:16.160
What a horrible joke.

01:03:16.160 --> 01:03:19.950
I have nothing to say to the likes of you who killed the King!

01:03:20.310 --> 01:03:20.950
Silence!

01:03:24.290 --> 01:03:28.400
I'll grind you and that shield mongrel into dust!

01:03:29.750 --> 01:03:30.480
Huh?

01:03:42.910 --> 01:03:44.790
What a ridiculous prosthetic arm,

01:03:44.790 --> 01:03:45.910
you coward!

01:03:46.660 --> 01:03:48.630
I do not have the blessings of the Spirits...

01:03:49.370 --> 01:03:50.580
nor the Sun.

01:03:51.910 --> 01:03:53.290
I didn't even have

01:03:53.290 --> 01:03:54.580
natural talent!

01:03:55.880 --> 01:03:58.790
Yet even someone like me, till the very end...

01:03:58.790 --> 01:04:00.100
was trusted by the King!

01:04:07.830 --> 01:04:09.650
Until the very end?

01:04:10.250 --> 01:04:12.410
In order to repay that favour,

01:04:12.410 --> 01:04:13.110
I...

01:04:13.790 --> 01:04:15.870
received this arm.

01:04:15.870 --> 01:04:17.650
Until the very end, you say?!

01:04:37.410 --> 01:04:38.290
Mash!

01:04:38.290 --> 01:04:39.000
I'm counting on you.

01:04:39.000 --> 01:04:39.970
Yes.

01:04:46.120 --> 01:04:47.480
Who are you?

01:04:48.700 --> 01:04:50.330
Together with Hassan of the Cursed Arm,

01:04:50.330 --> 01:04:51.660
we're here to rescue you!

01:04:51.660 --> 01:04:52.690
Don't.

01:04:55.500 --> 01:04:58.280
Those chains are Agravain's Iron Punishment.

01:04:58.750 --> 01:04:59.750
If we get too close,

01:04:59.750 --> 01:05:01.240
we'll get captured too.

01:05:16.040 --> 01:05:17.920
Senpa–

01:05:21.830 --> 01:05:22.830
Ah!

01:05:26.580 --> 01:05:28.640
What have I done?

01:05:30.660 --> 01:05:32.190
My bodily fluids are poison.

01:05:32.950 --> 01:05:35.150
My breath, sweat and saliva...

01:05:35.500 --> 01:05:37.830
are all lethal poisons.

01:05:37.830 --> 01:05:38.830
It can't be?

01:05:38.830 --> 01:05:41.250
The legendary Poison Girl of the West!

01:05:41.250 --> 01:05:42.740
Fujimaru!

01:05:58.700 --> 01:06:00.220
Mash's shield?

01:06:02.080 --> 01:06:05.470
That shield has the power to nullify impurities!

01:06:05.620 --> 01:06:07.000
Is that so?

01:06:07.000 --> 01:06:08.430
That shield is...

01:06:10.700 --> 01:06:11.500
Well.

01:06:11.500 --> 01:06:13.690
We need to escape from here now.

01:06:13.910 --> 01:06:14.910
Let's hurry.

01:06:18.410 --> 01:06:20.110
How warm...

01:06:25.700 --> 01:06:26.700
Senpai!

01:06:54.790 --> 01:06:56.160
That guy is...

01:06:56.160 --> 01:06:57.270
Agravain.

01:06:57.700 --> 01:06:59.480
One of the Knights of the Lion King.

01:06:59.480 --> 01:07:03.540
Even if you're thieves,
it's a fact that you are guests from afar.

01:07:03.540 --> 01:07:04.950
I welcome you.

01:07:04.950 --> 01:07:06.950
Master from Chaldea.

01:07:08.870 --> 01:07:12.960
You're no fun as usual, Agravain.

01:07:13.950 --> 01:07:15.290
Caster.

01:07:15.290 --> 01:07:16.920
What are you doing here?

01:07:17.500 --> 01:07:19.620
The same as always,

01:07:19.620 --> 01:07:22.880
I'm travelling only to seek the truth.

01:07:23.620 --> 01:07:25.040
The truth, huh?

01:07:25.040 --> 01:07:26.950
Then answer this.

01:07:26.950 --> 01:07:28.120
The Holy City...

01:07:28.120 --> 01:07:30.100
and the Sun-King's domain.

01:07:30.100 --> 01:07:31.020
After seeing that...

01:07:31.870 --> 01:07:33.620
from your side...

01:07:33.620 --> 01:07:36.190
are the Lion King's actions wrong?

01:07:37.000 --> 01:07:38.520
He's not wrong.

01:07:40.250 --> 01:07:41.290
Indeed.

01:07:41.290 --> 01:07:45.950
We're only seeking the path to preserve humanity.

01:07:46.070 --> 01:07:47.870
Everyone...

01:07:47.870 --> 01:07:49.160
respected...

01:07:49.160 --> 01:07:50.870
and helped one another.

01:07:51.370 --> 01:07:54.910
Life in the Holy City was lovely indeed, Agravain.

01:07:55.120 --> 01:07:58.290
In that case, return to
the Holy City and join the Round Table.

01:07:58.290 --> 01:08:00.040
Gareth's empty seat.

01:08:00.040 --> 01:08:01.380
You're worthy to fill it.

01:08:03.950 --> 01:08:06.290
I have always been ambivalent.

01:08:06.290 --> 01:08:08.340
I believed true justice didn't exist.

01:08:09.160 --> 01:08:11.810
I even considered returning to the Lion King's side.

01:08:13.330 --> 01:08:14.790
But...

01:08:14.790 --> 01:08:17.270
my disciples gave me some inspiration.

01:08:18.700 --> 01:08:20.150
Disciples?

01:08:20.450 --> 01:08:21.450
I see.

01:08:40.000 --> 01:08:42.460
If everything exists in the mind,

01:08:42.870 --> 01:08:46.050
then leave behind the two extremes and take the middle away.

01:08:46.580 --> 01:08:49.010
The Gods and Buddhas all see it clearly.

01:08:49.450 --> 01:08:50.830
Caster....

01:08:50.830 --> 01:08:52.010
Xuanzang Sanzang!

01:08:53.450 --> 01:08:55.370
With the heavenly wrath.

01:08:55.370 --> 01:08:56.850
I shall enlighten you!

01:08:57.700 --> 01:08:59.350
Soul Splitting Spell!

01:09:15.370 --> 01:09:16.370
Get them.

01:09:19.330 --> 01:09:21.000
No matter how deep the darkness,

01:09:22.000 --> 01:09:25.750
as long as there is one heart
determined to save everyone,

01:09:25.750 --> 01:09:26.910
I...

01:09:26.910 --> 01:09:28.090
will lead the way!

01:09:28.540 --> 01:09:30.160
Xuanzang Sanzang...

01:09:30.160 --> 01:09:31.200
Could it be?

01:09:31.200 --> 01:09:32.430
The Sanzang Priest!

01:09:34.100 --> 01:09:36.430
She's such a skilled warrior Servant!

01:09:42.120 --> 01:09:43.450
Don't be so full of yourself,

01:09:43.450 --> 01:09:44.540
Bedivere!

01:09:45.080 --> 01:09:47.290
Just because there were empty seats...

01:09:47.290 --> 01:09:48.190
You third class!

01:09:54.410 --> 01:09:56.490
You're not even a decent fighter!

01:09:58.370 --> 01:10:01.330
You couldn't protect your lord properly!

01:10:04.200 --> 01:10:05.360
You bastard...

01:10:05.360 --> 01:10:07.910
Father may have thought well of you, but...

01:10:07.910 --> 01:10:09.670
aren't you just a coward?

01:10:09.750 --> 01:10:11.540
Even so...

01:10:11.540 --> 01:10:12.540
I...

01:10:12.790 --> 01:10:13.680
For the King...

01:10:18.330 --> 01:10:21.250
Boil over wrath of the stars!

01:10:21.250 --> 01:10:22.330
Clarent...

01:10:22.620 --> 01:10:24.270
Blood Arthur!

01:10:24.410 --> 01:10:25.660
Switch on!

01:10:25.950 --> 01:10:27.230
Airgetlám!

01:10:38.750 --> 01:10:40.620
Mordred!

01:10:41.830 --> 01:10:42.920
Fujimaru!

01:10:43.620 --> 01:10:44.870
Over here!

01:10:44.870 --> 01:10:46.040
You two!

01:11:23.250 --> 01:11:24.540
Serenity!

01:11:24.540 --> 01:11:25.540
You're awake.

01:11:26.790 --> 01:11:28.210
I'm sorry.

01:11:29.200 --> 01:11:30.040
No worries.

01:11:30.040 --> 01:11:31.000
That's not it!

01:11:32.500 --> 01:11:33.700
Cursed Arm...

01:11:33.700 --> 01:11:34.950
I...

01:11:34.950 --> 01:11:36.280
despite being a Hassan,

01:11:37.160 --> 01:11:41.100
the location of the Azrael Shrine was revealed to Agravain.

01:11:43.080 --> 01:11:45.410
It must be Agravain’s Noble Phantasm.

01:11:45.410 --> 01:11:47.120
To resist that man...

01:11:47.120 --> 01:11:48.810
is quite a difficult thing.

01:11:49.580 --> 01:11:52.250
As for what sleeps in the Shrine,

01:11:52.250 --> 01:11:53.530
I did not reveal it.

01:11:54.250 --> 01:11:55.370
However...

01:11:55.370 --> 01:11:56.990
the location of the East Village is...

01:11:57.870 --> 01:11:58.700
Let's hurry!

01:12:03.330 --> 01:12:04.870
Don't worry.

01:12:04.870 --> 01:12:06.210
I'll definitely protect everyone.

01:12:06.540 --> 01:12:07.620
Promise?

01:12:07.620 --> 01:12:09.580
I'll work hard on my archery.

01:12:09.580 --> 01:12:10.670
Yeah.

01:12:29.910 --> 01:12:31.360
This makes twenty!

01:12:40.750 --> 01:12:41.830
A surprise attack!

01:12:41.830 --> 01:12:44.160
For one of the Round Table,
that's pretty underhanded!

01:12:56.370 --> 01:12:58.090
An enemy is an enemy.

01:12:59.330 --> 01:13:00.850
Fairplay isn't an option.

01:13:11.620 --> 01:13:13.190
These monsters...

01:13:17.000 --> 01:13:19.450
Please head to the Holy Shrine, Fujimaru.

01:13:20.200 --> 01:13:23.910
We've prepared an escape for those who can't fight.

01:13:23.910 --> 01:13:26.620
We shall search for survivors.

01:13:26.830 --> 01:13:27.700
Let's go!

01:13:32.250 --> 01:13:33.610
Unforgivable!

01:13:49.500 --> 01:13:50.790
Excellent.

01:13:50.790 --> 01:13:52.150
Arash Kamangir.

01:13:54.080 --> 01:13:56.570
Arondight Overload!

01:14:01.410 --> 01:14:02.360
That light is...

01:14:12.160 --> 01:14:13.650
Arash!

01:14:14.620 --> 01:14:16.010
No way...

01:14:29.660 --> 01:14:32.140
I am in sorrow.

01:14:33.450 --> 01:14:34.940
Sir Tristan!

01:14:35.370 --> 01:14:40.280
It really is you, Sir Bedivere.

01:14:41.080 --> 01:14:42.860
Your eyes are...

01:14:43.200 --> 01:14:44.580
Yes.

01:14:44.580 --> 01:14:47.830
To avoid seeing ever-growing sorrow...

01:14:49.290 --> 01:14:50.660
Sorrow?

01:14:51.830 --> 01:14:54.250
Has the Round Table lost its pride?!

01:14:54.670 --> 01:14:58.250
This is how I'll show my loyalty to the Lion King.

01:15:00.660 --> 01:15:02.080
You two.

01:15:02.080 --> 01:15:03.720
Please don't interfere.

01:15:22.040 --> 01:15:23.720
As expected.

01:15:32.540 --> 01:15:35.500
For you to release such killing intent.

01:15:36.330 --> 01:15:37.950
How hurtful.

01:15:39.500 --> 01:15:44.050
Other than you, no other Knight was willing to walk with me.

01:15:46.450 --> 01:15:47.660
We were–

01:15:47.660 --> 01:15:48.750
Friends.

01:15:49.450 --> 01:15:51.680
That's why, there are things I can't forgive!

01:15:52.910 --> 01:15:55.580
If the King truly condones your conduct

01:15:55.580 --> 01:15:59.750
I will step over your corpse to reach my King!

01:15:59.750 --> 01:16:03.450
To think Sir Bedivere
would now oppose the King.

01:16:03.450 --> 01:16:07.570
I don't know a tale more sorrowful than this.

01:16:11.250 --> 01:16:13.120
Switch on, Airgetlám!

01:16:29.330 --> 01:16:31.890
The sound of flesh and bones burning...

01:16:33.000 --> 01:16:34.390
This scent...

01:16:35.000 --> 01:16:36.190
How pitiful...

01:16:37.410 --> 01:16:39.310
Let's end this tragedy.

01:16:40.330 --> 01:16:42.320
In the name of our friendship.

01:16:53.810 --> 01:16:54.830
That shield...

01:17:23.540 --> 01:17:25.450
With this Command Spell, I order you!

01:17:25.450 --> 01:17:27.290
Mash Kyrielight!

01:17:27.290 --> 01:17:29.910
Let the walls of ancient determination shine.

01:17:29.910 --> 01:17:32.280
Protect those without strength!

01:17:33.000 --> 01:17:34.080
Yes!

01:17:54.200 --> 01:17:55.350
At this rate...

01:18:03.410 --> 01:18:04.620
Failnaught!

01:18:04.620 --> 01:18:06.830
Dance to my heart's content!

01:18:06.830 --> 01:18:08.400
Take my soul and go forth!

01:18:09.200 --> 01:18:10.570
Switch on, Airgetlám!

01:18:40.660 --> 01:18:42.290
Indeed.

01:18:42.290 --> 01:18:44.770
It's sorrowful after all.

01:18:51.290 --> 01:18:53.910
In the sky, A huge magical disturbance detected!

01:18:53.910 --> 01:18:54.580
Everyone!

01:18:54.580 --> 01:18:56.200
Hurry up and get out of there!

01:19:15.830 --> 01:19:18.450
This is the Lion King's judgement.

01:19:18.450 --> 01:19:20.600
The Holy Lance Rhongomyniad.

01:19:21.330 --> 01:19:23.100
The pillar of purification.

01:19:23.620 --> 01:19:25.080
Tristan!

01:19:25.080 --> 01:19:27.000
Are you all out of your mind?!

01:19:27.000 --> 01:19:29.860
Do you think insanity would justify our actions?

01:19:31.500 --> 01:19:36.320
In order to preserve humanity,
our King made a divine decision.

01:19:37.540 --> 01:19:40.870
There can be no place for emotions when delivering judgement.

01:19:42.250 --> 01:19:44.160
The King has finally

01:19:44.160 --> 01:19:47.210
discarded her human heart.

01:19:48.540 --> 01:19:49.840
Such a thing...

01:19:54.500 --> 01:19:55.830
Farewell.

01:19:55.830 --> 01:19:57.800
My dearest friend.

01:20:04.290 --> 01:20:05.580
Please escape!

01:20:05.580 --> 01:20:06.950
With that shield,

01:20:06.950 --> 01:20:09.250
you still have a chance to flee!

01:20:09.250 --> 01:20:10.250
But...

01:20:10.250 --> 01:20:11.790
What about the villagers?

01:20:11.790 --> 01:20:12.480
What about you, Bedivere?

01:20:17.620 --> 01:20:21.210
This is it for me.

01:20:24.660 --> 01:20:26.040
Don't give up.

01:20:30.620 --> 01:20:33.460
There's still a way.

01:20:34.660 --> 01:20:36.090
Arash...

01:20:37.290 --> 01:20:40.050
This is not where you die.

01:20:40.450 --> 01:20:41.430
Stop it!

01:20:43.330 --> 01:20:44.750
Sorry.

01:20:44.750 --> 01:20:47.040
Even though I told you all those things,

01:20:47.040 --> 01:20:49.750
I'm just the same as you.

01:20:49.750 --> 01:20:50.980
Please stop!

01:20:53.580 --> 01:20:55.150
That loyalty of yours.

01:20:55.750 --> 01:20:58.050
Show me you can protect it till the very end!

01:21:02.120 --> 01:21:04.540
O holy lord of the sun’s rays,

01:21:05.290 --> 01:21:07.000
The one who bestows all wisdom,

01:21:07.000 --> 01:21:08.870
The majesty...

01:21:08.870 --> 01:21:11.960
and strength. O shining lord.

01:21:15.120 --> 01:21:16.500
My heart.

01:21:16.500 --> 01:21:18.040
my thoughts.

01:21:18.040 --> 01:21:20.930
my selfishness.

01:21:21.830 --> 01:21:23.040
Come.

01:21:23.040 --> 01:21:25.500
You who created the moon and the stars.

01:21:26.330 --> 01:21:27.370
My deeds.

01:21:27.370 --> 01:21:28.370
My end.

01:21:29.160 --> 01:21:32.070
Behold, my Spenta Armaiti!

01:21:36.410 --> 01:21:39.490
As I unleash this final arrow,

01:21:39.790 --> 01:21:43.450
let my very being be shredded into dust!

01:21:44.750 --> 01:21:47.120
Stella!

01:23:22.290 --> 01:23:23.770
Tough.

01:23:24.290 --> 01:23:25.930
It has been a tough journey.

01:23:28.290 --> 01:23:31.980
This is the conclusion of the journey bestowed upon me.

01:23:33.040 --> 01:23:37.020
The final journey for the man in Paradise.

01:23:39.120 --> 01:23:41.750
No matter the sacrifice,

01:23:41.750 --> 01:23:43.610
this time I will...

01:23:45.450 --> 01:23:46.990
This time...

01:23:47.500 --> 01:23:49.080
with these hands...

01:23:50.290 --> 01:23:53.000
I will kill my King.

01:23:57.330 --> 01:24:02.450
The ending

01:24:02.450 --> 01:24:11.290
that I never want to admit

01:24:11.290 --> 01:24:25.050
The story of a foolish traveler

01:24:26.080 --> 01:24:29.450
The people I love

01:24:29.450 --> 01:24:38.290
Maybe I am just scared to lose their futures

01:24:38.290 --> 01:24:41.500
Burn as much as you like

01:24:41.500 --> 01:24:44.500
but do not leave me

01:24:44.500 --> 01:24:48.000
From a long time ago

01:24:48.000 --> 01:24:52.120
a promise was made

01:24:52.120 --> 01:24:55.500
Please do not forgive me

01:24:55.500 --> 01:24:58.120
please do not leave me

01:24:58.120 --> 01:25:06.040
With those cruel eyes of yours

01:25:06.040 --> 01:25:13.330
Although it is a little too late

01:25:13.330 --> 01:25:17.000
just push me away

01:25:38.950 --> 01:25:47.040
The more I hope to correct my existence

01:25:47.040 --> 01:25:50.910
The more I have realized

01:25:50.910 --> 01:25:54.700
my own disloyalty

01:25:54.700 --> 01:25:57.080
Dedicating everything to you

01:25:57.080 --> 01:25:59.250
The one who was satisfied

01:25:59.250 --> 01:26:01.700
Satisfied with giving

01:26:01.700 --> 01:26:05.080
It was actually me

01:26:05.080 --> 01:26:07.120
What I longed for

01:26:07.120 --> 01:26:09.200
what I've actually longed for

01:26:09.200 --> 01:26:14.040
is the paradise that I finally saw

01:26:14.040 --> 01:26:16.410
I have trampled on it

01:26:16.410 --> 01:26:18.500
I have destroyed it

01:26:18.500 --> 01:26:23.330
to the point that there's no longer any trace

01:26:23.330 --> 01:26:29.080
A thin thread we call a bond

01:26:29.080 --> 01:26:33.120
Before I reach it

01:26:33.120 --> 01:26:36.410
sever it

01:26:45.700 --> 01:26:47.910
Goodbye

01:26:47.910 --> 01:26:50.330
Before you say it through my mouth

01:26:50.330 --> 01:26:55.080
It's all right to say it in small sentences

01:26:55.080 --> 01:26:57.000
Goodbye

01:26:57.000 --> 01:26:59.660
As long as I can say those words

01:26:59.660 --> 01:27:03.450
then I am able to show my love

01:27:03.450 --> 01:27:10.220
To you

01:27:18.410 --> 01:27:20.410
Burn as much as you like

01:27:20.410 --> 01:27:22.500
but don't leave me

01:27:22.500 --> 01:27:24.830
From a long time ago

01:27:24.830 --> 01:27:27.330
a promise made

01:27:27.330 --> 01:27:29.580
I'm tired of crying

01:27:29.580 --> 01:27:31.870
I've reached my limit

01:27:31.870 --> 01:27:36.790
The ending is finally within my grasp

01:27:36.790 --> 01:27:38.830
Don't forgive me

01:27:38.830 --> 01:27:41.040
Don't leave me alone

01:27:41.040 --> 01:27:46.080
with those cruel eyes of yours

01:27:46.080 --> 01:27:51.660
I have lost the right to speak to you

01:27:51.660 --> 01:27:56.370
A monologue no one can hear

01:27:56.370 --> 01:28:00.950
Turn the incoherent voice into a scream

01:28:00.950 --> 01:28:11.880
through the eye of a swirling storm

01:28:38.160 --> 01:28:40.620
Destroying the villages to the ground.

01:28:41.040 --> 01:28:44.000
Is that really the will of King Arthur?

01:28:45.250 --> 01:28:47.250
Our King is perfect.

01:28:47.250 --> 01:28:49.410
Even from the beginning,
the Round Table you thought you knew

01:28:49.410 --> 01:28:50.700
never really existed.

01:28:50.700 --> 01:28:51.620
This time...

01:28:51.620 --> 01:28:53.790
I'll die as my Father's knight!

01:28:53.790 --> 01:28:56.120
We, who swore loyalty to the Lion King

01:28:56.120 --> 01:28:57.080
are already sinners.

01:28:57.080 --> 01:28:59.870
You had absolutely no chance of victory.

01:28:59.870 --> 01:29:01.790
Will you serve me?

01:29:01.790 --> 01:29:03.560
Or will you depart from my presence?

01:29:04.910 --> 01:29:09.350
Defeating the Lion King is my only destiny!

01:29:11.200 --> 01:29:13.820
Are you still able to fight?

01:29:14.910 --> 01:29:15.620
Your destiny...

01:29:15.620 --> 01:29:17.200
Divine Realm of the Round Table: Camelot
Your destiny...

01:29:17.200 --> 01:29:19.290
can you still fulfill it?
Divine Realm of the Round Table: Camelot

01:29:19.290 --> 01:29:19.320
can you still fulfill it?

01:29:21.410 --> 01:29:22.330
That is...

01:29:23.370 --> 01:29:25.350
my atonement.
